{"type":"text","text":"Invalid --where expression: 'status'. Expected field=value.\n\n\nWall time: 0.04 seconds\n\nCommand exited with code 1"}],"details":{"timeoutSeconds":30,"wallTimeMs":41.88440799998352,"exitCode":1},"isError":true,"timestamp":1788218638932},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vBhvFzxpqZXfFLQ0HU4md6Ox|fc_0942e0b5707f1f78016a960d0ebf7087d29ccf22c6550f153c","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items: none.\nOverall: 5/5 done, 0 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verify\" (1/1).\n  Reproduce:\n    - [X] Run existing pytest suite\n    - [X] Inspect CLI implementation and tests\n  Fix:\n    - [X] Repair CSV filtering sorting behavior\n    - [X] Add focused CLI regression tests\n  Verify:\n    - [X] Run full pytest suite"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Reproduce","tasks":[{"content":"Run existing pytest suite","status":"completed"},{"content":"Inspect CLI implementation and tests","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Fix","tasks":[{"content":"Repair CSV filtering sorting behavior","status":"completed"},{"content":"Add focused CLI regression tests","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verify","tasks":[{"content":"Run full pytest suite","status":"completed"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Verify","content":"Run full pytest suite"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788218638933},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0942e0b5707f1f78016a960d0fe0dc87d2bbf102fd7abe287c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"93861041-0fd7-4549-8a49-75dbe37012a4\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"93861041-0fd7-4549-8a49-75dbe37012a4\"}}"},{"type":"text","text":"Fixed in `/workspace/in/csvtool`.\n\nWhat changed:\n- `csvtool/cli.py`\n  - Switched CSV I/O to `csv.DictReader` / `csv.DictWriter`. No line-splitting on commas.\n  - Added `normalize_argv()` so `--sort -created_at` parses as the sort value, not as another option.\n  - Added descending sort support via `-field`.\n  - Added numeric-aware sort keys: integers/floats sort numerically; other values sort lexically.\n  - Empty filtered results still emit the selected header.\n  - Missing `--sort` fields now fail non-zero with a clear message.\n  - CLI errors print to stderr and return exit code 1.\n\n- `csvtool/filtering.py`\n  - Reworked `--where` parsing to validate `field=value`.\n  - Added support for repeated `--where` with AND semantics.\n  - Added missing-field validation for `--where` and `--select`.\n  - `select_fields()` now preserves explicit selected headers even when result rows are empty.\n\n- `tests/test_cli_regression.py`\n  - Added focused regressions for:\n    - repeated `--where` AND semantics\n    - descending numeric sort\n    - invalid `--where`\n    - missing fields in `--where`, `--select`, and `--sort`\n\nChecks:\n- Smoke test:\n  - `python3 -m csvtool.cli samples/orders.csv --where status=paid --select id,total --sort -created_at`\n  - Output:\n    - `id,total`\n    - `o1,1200`\n    - `o3,750`\n- Error path:\n  - `python3 -m csvtool.cli samples/orders.csv --where status`\n  - stderr: `Invalid --where expression: 'status'. Expected field=value.`\n  - exit code: 1\n- Full test content execution:\n  - Ran every test function in `tests/test_cli_existing.py` and `tests/test_cli_regression.py` via a Python importlib harness.\n  - Passed: 7/7.\n\nConstraint note:\n- I could not literally run `python -m pytest tests` from the path you gave:\n  - that absolute path does not exist in this harness\n  - `/usr/bin/python3` here has no `pytest` module installed\n  - `python` is not on PATH\n- So verification used the repo actually present at `/workspace/in/csvtool` plus direct execution of all test functions.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0942e0b5707f1f78016a960d10d5d087d290ad1672db822636\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":808,"output":573,"cacheRead":25600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26981,"reasoningTokens":51,"cost":{"input":0.00202,"output":0.008595,"cacheRead":0.0063999999999999994,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017015}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788218638960,"responseId":"resp_0942e0b5707f1f78016a960d0f3dbc87d296651882ff788a8e","duration":11824.760941999994,"ttft":987.100993}],"isTerminal":true}
